    "detail": {
      "id": 1000984,
      "name": "[Affinity] Moonlit Adventure",
      "desc": "Lucia has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>Secret Friend</color>.\nSecret Friend: When <color=#FFFFFF>Dreamer's Nursery Rhyme</color> deals additional DMG, ignore 18% of enemy All-Attribute RES and have 5% increased Decibel Generation Rate. Each time Lucia performs a skill upgrade, she gains 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Echo</color>, stacking up to 4 times. When <color=#FFFFFF>Dreamer's Nursery Rhyme</color> ends, if Lucia has any <color=#FFFFFF>Echo</color> stacks, 1 stack is consumed to reapply <color=#FFFFFF>Dreamer's Nursery Rhyme</color> to all squad members.",
      "desc2": "Keen Ether perception, vast Ethereal knowledge, exceptional combat skills, and an ever-growing curiosity — without a doubt, Lucia is one of the finest Hollow companions.\n...And after agreeing to seek the \"Doppelganger\" together, that boundless energy has reached even greater heights.",
